#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3122
msgid "This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ມີການລົງທະບຽນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ອີກ."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3129
